[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14760.15, "timestamp": "04:06:00", "text": "你喜歡YouTube還是Twitch？  問得好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14777.349, "timestamp": "04:06:17", "text": "。呃，我最初是在Twitch上開始的。所以，Twitch 永遠都會是我們的家，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14780.309, "timestamp": "04:06:20", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14785.99, "timestamp": "04:06:25", "text": "沒錯。我也喜歡YouTube。雖然還不錯，但我更喜歡 YouTube 的聊天功能。不，是Twitch的聊天體驗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14796.79, "timestamp": "04:06:36", "text": "。  Twitch聊天體驗很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14816.469, "timestamp": "04:06:56", "text": "現在還有蛋糕。我每場比賽都會在那裡進行多路"}]